    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bb7c9df017e8a824e4c5112c3eabb863cf56fd59da6d302ffde3d6b3504add74",
      "text": "Arrival in Rio de Janeiro. Meet at the airport and transfer to the hotel to check in and rest after your flight.\n\nOn the drive into the city, Rio's defining features begin to appear: green mountains, palm trees, the ocean and bays. In the evening, lights gradually come on across the hillsides and neighbourhoods. After check-in, the rest of the day is free. You can head to the beach, stroll along the promenade or sit in one of the open-air cafés by the ocean.\n\nRio's beachfront sets the mood for the journey straight away. Cafés by the water serve fruit drinks, while the promenades and sand stay lively until late in the evening. Green slopes rise behind the buildings, keeping the ocean and mountains in view even on a casual walk around the neighbourhood.",
      "provenance": {
